          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-[#0070f3] dark:text-cyan-400 font-serif font-bold text-xs">
              W
            </span>
            <span class="font-medium text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">The Free Software & Startup Encyclopedia</span>
