                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-200/70 dark:border-white/5">
                  <th scope="row" class="py-2 pr-2 font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 align-top">
                    Alma mater
                  </th>
                  <td class="py-2 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 align-top">
                    Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech)<br />
                    <span class="text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Computer Science and Engineering</span>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-200/70 dark:border-white/5">
                  <th scope="row" class="py-2 pr-2 font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 align-top">
                    Occupation
                  </th>
                  <td class="py-2 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 align-top">
                    Independent software developer • technology entrepreneur • AI builder
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-200/70 dark:border-white/5">
                  <th scope="row" class="py-2 pr-2 font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 align-top">
                    Known for
                  </th>
                  <td class="py-2 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 align-top space-y-1">
                    <div class="font-medium">• Founder of Prometrion</div>
                    <div>• Prometrion AI</div>
                    <div>• LocalLink Marketplace</div>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-200/70 dark:border-white/5">
                  <th scope="row" class="py-2 pr-2 font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 align-top">
                    Organization
                  </th>
                  <td class="py-2 font-medium text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 align-top">
                    <a href="#prometrion-company" class="hover:underline">Prometrion</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr class="border-b border-neutral-200/70 dark:border-white/5">
                  <th scope="row" class="py-2 pr-2 font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 align-top">
                    Key stack
                  </th>
